        "product_summary": "Contrasting textile panels: Coarse woven quarters combine with camouflage sections across the forefoot and heel.\n\nShort lace row: Two pairs of eyelets hold the front cord above the tongue, forming the actual low-cut lace-up profile.\n\nApron toe stitching: A raised seam follows the forefoot panel, visible in the original front and top views.\n\nRubber outsole: The underside photograph shows block and groove sections, while the light sidewall carries a speckled finish.\n\nTwo colour directions: The source lists Black and Beige in EU39-48 for wholesale colour-size assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
